SUMMARY:Deadline 17:00 GMT: TBG+S / TOKAS International Residency Exchange 
 2027: three months in Tokyo for an Irish or Ireland-based visual artist
DESCRIPTION:Closes 27 Nov 2026 at 17:00 GMT.\n\nTemple Bar Gallery + Studio
 s in Dublin sends one visual artist to Tokyo Arts and Space for a three-mo
 nth residency in autumn 2027\, as part of its exchange with TOKAS. WHO: pr
 ofessional practising visual artists who either live in Ireland or are Iri
 sh and live anywhere in the world.\n\nOrganisation: Temple Bar Gallery + S
 tudios (Dublin) with Tokyo Arts and Space (TOKAS)\nLocation: Tokyo Arts an
 d Space\, Sumida City\, Tokyo\, Japan. For artists living in Ireland and I
 rish artists living anywhere.\nAward: A stipend covering living and workin
 g expenses\, travel to and from Tokyo\, and on-site single-room accommodat
 ion. The stipend amount is not given on the call page. No application fee 
 stated.\nDuration: 3 months\, September to November 2027\n\nMore: https://
 www.templebargallery.com/studios-residencies/international-residencies/tbg
 -s-tokas-international-residency-exchange?utm_source=artificialnouveaugran
 tdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.templebargallery.com/studios-residencies/international-resi
 dencies/tbg-s-tokas-international-residency-exchange?utm_source=artificial
 nouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Tokyo Arts and Space\, Sumida City\, Tokyo\, Japan. For artists li
 ving in Ireland and Irish artists living anywhere.
END:VEVENT
